      <p class="text-text-light text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-10" data-lang-en="After ten years away, three chefs are rebuilding Canada's seat at the International Catering Cup in Lyon. This is the case for backing them." data-lang-fr="Après dix ans d'absence, trois chefs rebâtissent la place du Canada à l'International Catering Cup à Lyon. Voici pourquoi les soutenir.">After ten years away, three chefs are rebuilding Canada's seat at the International Catering Cup in Lyon. This is the case for backing them.</p>
